WEBVTT

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:22.620
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:27.370
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.210
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:58.970
♪As such♪

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.850
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.010
♪As such♪

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.410
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:12.850
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.770
♪Everywhere♪

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:21.850
♪I regret not
the time we spent together♪

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:27.850
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:33.530
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:40.450
♪A cherished love♪

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:46.090
♪Can never be parted♪

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:52.490
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:01:52.850 --> 00:02:01.022
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:07.810
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:11.350
=Episode 7=
(Deviated Spirit)

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.930
Nie Mingjue.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.500
Lan Xichen.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.330
Jin Guangyao.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.230
We hereby take an oath
to become sworn brothers.

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:21.720
We vow not to seek fame and fortune,

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.410
and vow to be of one heart and one mind,
and to help the needy.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.400
May the heaven and the earth
be our witness.

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:29.260
If one were to think otherwise,

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:32.620
they shall face a thousand accusing fingers
and be torn limb from limb.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.180
(Months later,)

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.479
(Wei Wuxian went to Qiongqi Road,)

00:02:37.479 --> 00:02:39.080
(saved Wen Ning and his clan)

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.180
(and took them
to the Yiling Burial Mounds.)

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.120
He forced his way to Qiongqi Road,

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.530
killed the foremen,
and took away the Wen dogs.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.280
How dare he!

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:47.440
We should have made him hand over
the Stygian Tiger Amulet, after all.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.020
Wangji.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:00.460
Brother.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:01.670
I

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:05.520
wish to bring someone
back to the Cloud Recesses.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.700
Back to the Cloud Recesses?

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.220
I want to bring him back,

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:10.810
and hide him away.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:13.760
But he is not willing.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.780
What are you doing, Hanguang-jun?

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:30.860
On behalf of Wei Wuxian,

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.860
I apologize for what happened
at Qiongqi Road.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:35.260
Both of us are indebted
to the cultivators he saved,

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.530
Wen Ning,

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:38.220
and his sister, Wen Qing.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.240
As such...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.730
What do you mean by indebted?

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.500
Was the massacre of the Jiang Clan
not the doing of the Wen dogs back then?

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:45.830
This Wen Qing did not seem

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.040
to have participated in any of the
murders during the Sunshot Campaign.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.040
But neither did she stop them.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.740
She stood by the side
as the Wens committed heinous misdeeds.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.130
Now that the Wens have perished,

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.890
she deserves to suffer for her inaction.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.440
Clan Leader Nie is right.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.470
Chifeng-zun is right.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.050
Please settle down, everyone.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.500
That is not the subject

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.050
of today's conference.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.170
Clan Leader Jiang.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.170
Nowadays, it seems that everyone is saying

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:14.610
that the Jiang Clan of Yunmeng
depends solely on Wei Wuxian.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:16.380
What is going on with that?

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.650
If you ask me,

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.900
I think Wei Wuxian had planned

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.900
to take away those Wen dogs
in the first place.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.540
What do you mean?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.440
He used the opportunity
to leave the Jiang Clan

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.830
and he possesses
the Stygian Tiger Amulet.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.830
Are you sure he is not doing this
so that he can form a clan of his own?

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:34.830
No.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:37.240
He has always been like that
since he was a child.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:38.300
He does whatever he wants.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.540
Even my father
couldn't do anything about it.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.190
Brother Fengmian
couldn't do anything about him?

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:47.010
I'm afraid Brother Fengmian
was simply biased.

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:53.310
Did you know what he said yesterday,
Clan Leader Jiang?

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.450
"I don't give a heck about Jiang Wanyin
as the head of the clan."

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.040
No.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.460
I never heard Wei Ying said that.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.730
Neither did I hear him say anything

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.730
disrespectful towards Clan Leader Jiang.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.360
Is that so?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.060
Each sentence from Mr. Wei
was more incredulous than the previous.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.300
I'm sure he implied
something of the sort somehow.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.660
I knew something would go wrong
with his demonic cultivation.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.030
For the sake of a few Wen dogs,

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.340
he murdered our own!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.570
It's not murder.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.210
I...

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.210
I don't mean anything else.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:28.660
But

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.660
if the foremen had indeed
abused the captives

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.210
and killed Wen Ning,

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:34.070
then it wouldn't be a murder.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:35.300
It would be revenge.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.200
Twisting the facts and right and wrong.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.150
A woman
with ulterior motives is indeed...

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.390
Who has ulterior motives?

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:43.650
You know well what I'm talking about.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.720
He flirted with you
back inside the Xuanwu Cave,

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.160
and here you are defending him
and twisting the facts!

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:55.640
It's her.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.090
I think her name was...

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:57.760
Mianmian.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.330
Right. Mianmian!

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.630
I knew it.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.710
No wonder she kept speaking up
for Wei Wuxian.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.850
Women will be women.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:06.250
I'm only telling the truth!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.790
What does that have to do
with me being a woman?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.790
What a disgrace.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.770
I can't believe she is one of ours.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:13.830
Shameless.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.320
She is actually
speaking up for Wei Wuxian.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:17.180
She has been
corrupted by him, all right.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.060
Why was someone like her allowed
to enter the Gold Point Pavillion?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.110
All of you...

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.440
Fine.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.830
Your voices are louder.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:29.350
All right.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.230
You get to decide.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.180
She took off her robe
and withdrew from her clan?

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:44.380
Who does she think she is bluffing?

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:47.150
That's right.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:48.450
Who would care if she left?

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:08.810
This woman

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.120
has much more backbone

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.350
than the mob of her clan.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.800
There are too many who are good
at twisting words to get what they want.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:16.800
It makes those who are willing
to speak out in the name of justice

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.570
all the more valuable.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.200
Mingjue, are you feeling better?

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:40.650
Much better.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.270
Your headache

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.760
is caused by the saber spirit.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.270
It cannot be cured,

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.760
but this Song of Clarity

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:48.970
may subdue it for now.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.480
Xichen has high cultivation,
and he is skilled in playing the zither.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.800
You have nothing to worry, Mingjue.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.140
Yao, your skills in playing the zither

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:56.240
are already some of the best
outside of Gusu.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.190
Were you taught by your mother?

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.190
She would never
teach me things like these.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:02.920
I learned by observing her.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.340
You are gifted.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.070
You would surely make swift progress

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.500
if you were guided by a master.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.630
The master is right before me.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.290
I don't dare trouble him.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.500
Why wouldn't you?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.790
What would you like to teach me,
Mr. Lan?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.300
How about the Song of Clarity?

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.710
I guess Clan Leader Lan really wants
to give Nie Mingjue and Jin Guangyao

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.530
an opportunity to resolve their tension.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:00.500
Brother.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.760
Time is up.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:02.920
We should take a break.

00:09:02.945 --> 00:09:03.360
(Nie)

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:04.920
(Nie)
You just had a break half an hour ago.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:05.990
Keep practicing.

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.060
You are not allowed to stop
until you have mastered it.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:12.290
Guangyao!

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.320
It's no use even
if you hide behind him!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:15.770
And you.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.280
Stop giving him all those useless junk!

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:20.510
Mingjue,

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:23.340
Huaisang only likes
to indulge in the arts and calligraphy.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.240
Those are hardly useless.

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:26.500
Guangyao is right!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.010
In cohorts now, are you?

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.650
Their relationship did improve a lot.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.200
Unfortunately...

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.500
Please calm down, Clan Leader Nie.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.330
I...

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.800
I will handle this matter
and give a proper explanation

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.810
to Clan Leader Nie
and other cultivation clans.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:43.510
Men!

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.320
Take Xue Yang to the dungeon!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.220
What? A lifetime in prison?

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:49.970
Mingjue, please calm down!

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.150
"Calm down"?

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:54.170
What did you promise me back then?

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.630
Blood for blood!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.260
Xue Yang has the blood of dozens
of lives of the Chang Clan on his hands,

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.680
and all he got was a life sentence?

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.970
Or are the rumors that the Jin Clan

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.430
intends to have Xue Yang

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:08.190
restore the Stygian Tiger Amulet true?

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.220
Mingjue,

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:11.597
how could you believe in idle rumors?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:12.950
As for Xue Yang,

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.610
I can't disobey

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.820
my father's orders!

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.430
Meng Yao!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.120
Stop pretending in front of me.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.540
Your ways won't work on me anymore.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.620
My ways?

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.510
Which of them?

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.710
You always say that I am
too calculating and dishonorable.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.470
But how could we be the same?

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.680
You were born with noble status,
and your cultivation is high.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:39.660
But what about me?

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.150
Do you think my position
in Jin Clan is steady?

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:45.140
Do you think I would be able to rise
to power after Jin Zixuan died?

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.720
Jin Guangshan has no intention
of letting me succeed him!

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:51.290
You think that I should be
afraid of nothing?

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:53.530
Well, I am afraid of everything!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.720
Even some people.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.970
You haven't changed at all, Meng Yao.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.590
Calculating, manipulative,
and using any means you can.

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:04.790
Absolutely shameless!

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:08.800
Mingjue,

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:12.260
you have killed far more than I did.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.870
So why is it that even though
I only killed a few cultivators

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:15.860
out of desperation,

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.870
you keep bringing it up, even until now?

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.610
Countless souls
have fallen under my saber.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.390
But I have never killed
out of my own desires,

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:27.840
let alone out of the power!

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.450
Are you saying that everyone
you killed deserved to die?

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.450
If I killed one to save a hundred,

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.570
would the good outweigh the bad,
or do I still deserve death?

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.230
To achieve great things,

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:37.790
sacrifices must be made!

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.890
Then why didn't you sacrifice yourself?

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:41.610
Is your life worth any more than theirs?

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.170
Are you any different from them?

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:46.340
Yes.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:49.830
They and I

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:53.010
are, of course, different.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.180
It's no wonder,

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.640
coming from a son of a prostitute!

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:06.970
Mingjue, you mustn't!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.420
Don't stop me!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:09.850
If things go on like this,

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:11.260
he will do harm to the world!

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.010
It is better to finish him off now!

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:14.600
Your spirit is in turmoil!

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:16.050
Mingjue!

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:20.580
(Nie)

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.240
As time passed,

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:26.730
the saber spirit grew stronger.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:31.160
You still dare to come here?

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:33.160
To acknowledge my mistakes.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.500
And today is the day
where I play the zither for you.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.260
You? Acknowledge your mistakes?

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:41.810
Xichen told me to give you time.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:43.540
Fine.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.670
I'll give you two months.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:47.050
Bring me Xue Yang's head.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.050
All right.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.620
I will personally bring you

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.770
Xue Yang's head in two months.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.920
Brother!

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:57.700
Brother,

00:12:58.720 --> 00:12:59.700
did you

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.670
order them to burn these?

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:02.880
Yes.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.180
Why?

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.460
Did you come to question me?

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:08.380
An entire year has passed,

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.870
and you still haven't learned
this one set of saber techniques.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.440
You fool around every day

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:12.280
instead of seeking to improve.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.720
How could the Nie Clan have produced
such a good-for-nothing like you?

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:16.200
So what?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.160
What did you say?

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:19.910
So what if I want to be
a good-for-nothing?

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:20.430
You...

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:21.370
Mingjue, please calm down.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:22.820
Huaisang,

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.400
your brother
is doing this for your own good.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.500
Don't anger him.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:26.890
He needs to remain calm

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.600
as I play the Song of Clarity for him.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:29.900
Sabers!

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.710
Practice! That's all you have me do!

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.310
Who wants to learn that dang thing?

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.050
What's the point of forcing me to learn

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.450
if I just don't like it?

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.190
I'm not going
to be the clan leader anyway!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.280
Whoever wants the position can have it!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.340
(Nie)

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.220
- Clan Leader!
- Clan Leader!

00:14:19.695 --> 00:14:20.695
Clan Leader!

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.650
Mingjue, your spirit is disturbed!
You must calm yourself!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.880
No! Don't kill me!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.250
Brother!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:51.840
Brother!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.140
I'm sorry.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.900
I won't make you mad anymore, Brother.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:28.050
This is...

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:29.570
My "Whatever"?

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:33.270
All right. The game is over.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.100
Lan Zhan?

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:54.640
We were in a hurry.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.540
So I carried you on my back.

00:15:57.039 --> 00:15:58.960
(Fangfei Palace)

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:02.950
All right.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.500
We will cause a bigger commotion.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.480
The more people
we can attract here, the better.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:11.600
(Fangfei Palace)

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:15.530
Mo Xuanyu!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.050
What are you doing?

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.580
This is my Uncle Guangyao's bedchamber!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.790
His bedchamber, you understand?

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.370
It's night already.
What's all the fuss about?

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.250
Wangji, what are you...

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:29.510
Inside the secret room.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.450
What is inside the secret room?

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.660
Were all of you unsatisfied
with the reception earlier?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:42.480
Is that why all of you are here?
To host a banquet at my place?

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:44.960
Yao.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.670
Would you allow us

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.050
to take a look
at your secret treasure room, please?

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.270
Xichen,

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:52.330
each clan's secret rooms are used
to store scarcely-used treasures.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:53.830
To ask me to open it up

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:54.670
all of a sudden...

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:55.880
Open it.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.210
All right.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:01.710
Please come with me.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.090
They say that the Lan Clan
values proper conduct the most.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.230
Forcefully entering
a clan leader's bedchambers

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:08.690
is proper conduct indeed.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:09.900
It's fine.

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:12.160
There is hardly anything
that can't be seen by others inside.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.010
Clan Leader Jin,

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.600
This is a powerful charm indeed.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:28.100
May I take a look at the object
it was used to suppress?

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:37.480
That is...

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:41.520
Xuanyu is right.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.300
This belonged to Wen Ruohan.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.300
It is surrounded by malicious energy.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.300
That is why I added a charm to it.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.370
You may all

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.680
have a look at it yourself.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.400
Isn't that Madam Jin?

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.060
Su?

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:55.970
Weren't you in the gardens
with guests earlier?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.180
When did you get here?

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.130
Su,

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.130
why are your hands so cold?

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:09.420
Su, what are you doing?

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.080
Su!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:29.160
(From what I could see earlier,)

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.560
(Qin Su didn't seem
to be controlled or manipulated.)

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.930
(Why would she suddenly
take her own life?)

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:34.830
(And that thing.)

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.410
(Where could he have moved it)

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.600
(in such a short time?)

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.990
Su...

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:45.420
Yao.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.390
You have my condolences.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:49.260
Xichen.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.780
I don't understand.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.210
You wanted me
to open the secret room all of a sudden.

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:55.210
And Su...

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.350
Is there something

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.300
you are not telling me?

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:02.970
Do you still remember
the Demonic Arm from Mo Village

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:05.210
and the legs of the corpse
in Traverse Hill?

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:06.970
Of course.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:11.750
The dismembered corpse
that had its soul scattered

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.130
was Mingjue.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.240
What?

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.540
Chifeng-zun?

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:18.050
Impossible!

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:21.540
How could it be Mingjue?

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:23.640
He has already been buried, hasn't he?

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.330
You and I saw it with our own eyes.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:29.080
Brother Xichen.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:30.770
You said

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.620
it was my brother?

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:34.950
Huaisang.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:36.420
I'm sorry.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:39.360
Huaisang.

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:40.540
Huaisang!

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:42.430
A dismembered body and a scattered soul.

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:45.790
Who would do such a heartless thing?

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:46.810
I don't know.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.060
The trail was broken
when we were trying

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.680
to locate the whereabouts of his head.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.000
So you guys are suspecting

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.010
that Mingjue's head is here?

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.160
Fine.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:00.700
Forget it.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.920
But how did you come
to the conclusion that it was here?

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:05.310
Xichen.

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:06.670
Hanguang-jun.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.670
Or

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:10.200
was it you,

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.180
Xuanyu?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.140
(How should I explain this?)

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.690
I was the one who expelled you
from the clan back then.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.140
If you have any grievances, come at me.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.700
But Su is...

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:26.180
Su is innocent!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:34.970
Mo Xuanyu!

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:36.750
You murdered Madam Jin!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.100
Surrender yourself!

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:48.120
(Whatever)

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.080
Xuanyu,

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:50.440
you drew

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.790
out the sword?

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:55.460
No, you are not Xuanyu.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:58.640
You are Wei Wuxian,
the Yiling Patriarch!

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:01.750
What are you after

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:03.210
that warrants you to do

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:04.710
a cruel thing to my wife?

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:05.830
Wait, Uncle Guangyao!

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.450
There must have been a misunderstanding!

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:08.470
A misunderstanding?

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:10.140
This sword's spirit

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.190
has long been sealed.

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:12.870
No one is able to draw it out.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.340
Except

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:16.680
for the Yiling Patriarch himself.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.260
Uncle. Uncle!

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:21.130
You whipped him
with Purple Lightning before, didn't you?

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.420
He didn't seize Xuanyu's soul by force!

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:23.830
Yes.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.360
He didn't seize someone's soul.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.710
But someone performed
a sacrificial ritual to revive him.

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:30.270
Wei Wuxian!

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:31.880
Don't even think
about leaving here alive today!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.300
Hanguang-jun! You...

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:49.930
(Fangfei Palace)
Lan Zhan.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.460
Are you sure about this?

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:52.870
Once we step out of this door,

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:54.630
your reputation will be ruined.

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:04.640
Jin Ling?

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.080
Jin Ling, let me...

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:14.490
Wei Ying!

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:30.210
♪The swallows♪

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:31.330
♪Fly away♪

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:33.450
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:22:33.890 --> 00:22:35.090
♪I strum the strings♪

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:36.290
♪And play the song♪

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:38.090
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:39.930
♪Who is sighing♪

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:40.970
♪In sorrow?♪

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:43.290
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:44.730
♪When all is said and done♪

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:47.370
♪I cherish every moment we are together♪

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:49.530
♪A toast♪

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:50.810
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:52.570
♪We sit in a boat,
gazing up to the moon♪

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:54.330
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:55.450
♪On the shore♪

00:22:55.490 --> 00:22:57.530
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:59.010
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:22:59.170 --> 00:23:00.330
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:02.170
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:03.930
♪No amount of gold♪

00:23:04.010 --> 00:23:07.410
♪Would bring me to give up
these precious memories♪

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:11.050
♪I wish never to forget those years♪

00:23:11.050 --> 00:23:13.770
♪I spent searching for you♪

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:15.290
♪Through the mountains and rivers♪

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.490
♪I've searched for you♪

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:20.610
♪There you were♪

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:23.050
♪By the dim light♪

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:27.050
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:30.370
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:32.810
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:35.130
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:37.810
♪Playing a song together♪

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:40.010
♪As we watch the sun set♪

00:23:40.450 --> 00:23:42.210
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:45.570
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
